{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46240","headline":"宿赤松山观题道人水阁兼寄郡守 · 贯休","name":"宿赤松山观题道人水阁兼寄郡守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠殿香軿倚翠棱，寒栖吾道寄孙登。\n岂应肘後终无分，见说仙中亦有僧。\n云敛石泉飞险窦，月明山鼠下枯藤。\n还如华顶清谈夜，因有新诗寄郑弘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}